Motorcycle Cluster
Author: Keith Conger <keith.conger@gmail.com>
http://development.thecongers.org/home/mcluster
License: GPLv2

Motorcycle Cluster Software

Requires:
* A Bluetooth CANBusGateway

Current features:
* Almost all features of built in instrument cluster of the 1200GS
* Night mode
* Audio warning hen low fuel threshold hit
* Suggests nearby fuel stations when low fuel threshold hit

Credits:
Most icons were sourced from: http://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Dashboard_icons
